From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:34:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-usi: Add the Tensor G3 USI

zuma's (Tensor G3) USI blocks are Exynos850-style, like Tensor G4's:
the mode lives in a system register, and the block's own control sits
at offset 0xc0. Document zuma's compatible with the Exynos850 fallback.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml
index 9a2a8867b..870ad437f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - google,gs101-usi
               - google,gs201-usi
+              - google,zuma-usi
               - google,zumapro-usi
               - samsung,exynos2200-usi
               - samsung,exynosautov9-usi
